---
import BaseLayout from '../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import KeepInTouch from '../components/KeepInTouch.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Keep in touch"
  description="Occasional updates from Editorial Intelligence — new research, findings as they emerge and invitations to take part."
>
  <div class="lab-inner container-site">

    <header class="lab-header">
      <p class="t-label mb-4">Editorial Intelligence</p>
      <h1 class="lab-h1">Keep in touch with Editorial Intelligence</h1>
      <p class="lab-lede">Occasional updates on new research, findings and ways to take part. Editorial Intelligence is being developed in public and tested through practitioner research; this list is how to follow that work without watching a feed.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="lab-signup-primary">
      <KeepInTouch variant="full" headline="" body="" />
    </div>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="lab-section">
      <h2 class="lab-h2">What you will receive</h2>
      <ul class="lab-list">
        <li>New practitioner research, and invitations to take part in it</li>
        <li>Findings as they emerge — labelled honestly when the sample is still small</li>
        <li>Field notes from active engagements: what the evidence showed, what changed, what held</li>
        <li>Early access to new tools, assessments and framework iterations</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="lab-note">Occasional means occasional. Updates go out when the work produces something worth sending, not on a schedule.</p>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="lab-section">
      <h2 class="lab-h2">Where the regular writing lives</h2>
      <div class="lab-prose">
        <p>The recurring newsletter is published on LinkedIn under the Editorial Intelligence name. If you want the regular reading rhythm, that is the place to find it.</p>
        <p>This list is different, and deliberately quieter. It is a direct line for research participation and for the things that do not fit a publishing schedule.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/writing" class="lab-archive-link">Browse the full writing archive →</a>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="lab-section">
      <h2 class="lab-h2">Taking part in the research</h2>
      <div class="lab-prose">
        <p>Joining this list is not the same as taking part in the research, and neither one signs you up for the other. The practitioner research has its own invitation, its own consent and its own permissions, which you choose question by question.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/compare-notes" class="lab-archive-link">Read the research invitation →</a>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lab-inner {
    max-width: 42rem;
    padding-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .lab-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .lab-h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lab-lede {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .lab-signup-primary {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }

  .lab-section {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .lab-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .lab-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .lab-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .lab-list li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .lab-note {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-tertiary);
  }

  .lab-prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lab-prose p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
  }

  .lab-archive-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .lab-archive-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
